  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cuamba-Lichinga, Improv. - Construction</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Cuamba-Lichinga, Improv.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Korttidsf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av v&#xe4;gen mellan Cuamba och Lichinga genom att asfaltera en k&#xf6;rbanebredd i mitten av v&#xe4;gytan. F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrings&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rden medf&#xf6;r att underh&#xe5;llskostnaderna minimeras fram tills en framtida upprustning av v&#xe4;gen genomf&#xf6;rs. Det svenska bidraget t&#xe4;cker  kostnaderna f&#xf6;r en k&#xf6;rbanebanebredd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short term improvements through provision of a single lane paved surface on the Cuamba-Lichinga road. The improvement implies the use of a new method minimizing maintenance costs until a future  rehabilitation of the road is carried out. The Swedish contribution covers the full cost for the single lane paving.</narrative>
  </description>
